        "subject": "Welcome to the ClinicIQ newsletter 🩺",
        "html": "=<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en-AU\">\n<head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" /></head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#f4f4f4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;\">\n  <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background:#f4f4f4;padding:20px 0;\">\n    <tr><td align=\"center\">\n      <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"max-width:600px;background:#ffffff;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #e0e0e0;\">\n        <tr><td style=\"background:#2C4A3C;padding:22px 24px;text-align:center;\">\n          <img src=\"https://downloads.cliniciq.com.au/icons/cliniciq-logo.png\" alt=\"ClinicIQ Solutions\" width=\"150\" style=\"display:block;margin:0 auto;max-width:150px;\" />\n        </td></tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding:24px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:#111827;\">\n          <p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;\">Thanks for subscribing!</p>\n          <p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;\">Every so often I'll send you practical tips, new calculators and tools built for practice nurses in Australian GP clinics — the same free-first approach as the rest of <a href=\"https://cliniciq.com.au\" style=\"color:#2C4A3C;\">cliniciq.com.au</a>.</p>\n          <p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;\">You can start with the free clinical and business calculators today — no practice sign-off needed.</p>\n          <p style=\"margin:0;\">John Saenz<br /><span style=\"color:#6b7280;font-size:13px;\">Registered Nurse & Founder, ClinicIQ Solutions</span></p>\n        </td></tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding:14px 24px 18px;font-size:12px;color:#6b7280;text-align:center;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n          You're receiving this because you subscribed at cliniciq.com.au ·\n          <a href=\"{{ 'https://johnsaenz.au/webhook/cliniciqunsub?id=' + $json.id + '&email=' + encodeURIComponent($json.email) }}\" style=\"color:#2C4A3C;\">Unsubscribe</a>\n        </td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </td></tr>\n  </table>\n</body>\n</html>",
