        "jsCode": "// Build the Telegram report for the admin (and release the poll lock).\nconst sd = $getWorkflowStaticData('global');\nsd.telegram = sd.telegram || {};\nsd.telegram.lock = 0;\nconst cfg = sd.telegram;\nconst sends = $('prepare sends').all().filter((i) => i.json && !i.json.skip);\nconst subject = $('parse newsletter').first().json.subject;\nconst n = sends.length;\nreturn [{ json: {\n  token: cfg.botToken || '',\n  chatId: String(cfg.adminChatId || ''),\n  text: n > 0\n    ? '✅ Newsletter sent to ' + n + ' subscriber' + (n === 1 ? '' : 's') + '.\\nSubject: ' + subject\n    : '⚠️ Newsletter prepared (\"' + subject + '\") but there are no subscribers — nothing was sent.',\n} }];"
